{"path":"biology/genetics/mendel/multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼","type":"knowledge","html":"<h1>遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼</h1>\n<p>两对及以上基因<strong>自由组合</strong>时，后代性状比=两对<strong>各自分离比的乘积</strong>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(3:1)\\times(3:1)=9:3:3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>），题目的&quot;变式&quot;都是把九个格子<strong>按表现型合并</strong>。这类题不会太为难人：<strong>比数之和一定是 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>16</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">16</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span></span></span></span>（两对）/<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span>（三对）</strong>，题目会留明显提示（&quot;子代中……的比例&quot;），先按提示排除，再用表秒判。</p>\n<h2>两对基因 9:3:3:1 的全部变式（背表）</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>表现型比例</th>\n<th>基因互作类型</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>9:3:3:1</td>\n<td>自由组合（无互作）</td>\n<td>双显、单显A、单显B、双隐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:7</td>\n<td>互补作用</td>\n<td>双显+其余=另一性状：显性互补才显性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:6:1</td>\n<td>累加作用</td>\n<td>双显、任意单显（同类）、双隐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>9:3:4</td>\n<td>隐性上位</td>\n<td>隐同源(B)隐去 A 表现型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>12:3:1</td>\n<td>显性上位</td>\n<td>显性 A 抑制 B 的表达</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>15:1</td>\n<td>重叠作用</td>\n<td>只要有显性即为显性性状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>13:3</td>\n<td>抑制基因</td>\n<td>存在抑制基因时全显（13=9+3+1）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1:4:6:4:1</td>\n<td>数量性状（累加）</td>\n<td>AABB：AaBB/AABb：…：aabb 连续分布</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>口诀</strong>：&quot;和为 16 是两对；7 是互补、6 是累加、4 是上位、1 是重叠、3 是抑制；数字越少越'挤'，看'谁压谁'定称呼。&quot;</p>\n<h2>三对及以上的快速处理</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>比数之和 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=64</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">64</span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）→ 三对；一般给&quot;三对独立遗传&quot;关键是<strong>拆开成单对</strong>分别算概率再乘；</li>\n<li>表现型种类 = 明确可能组合数；如问&quot;纯合子比例&quot;：每对 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\dfrac14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span> 相乘；</li>\n<li><strong>9:6:1 变体</strong>（如 27:37）不背，直接按&quot;双显/单显/双隐&quot;字典合并。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>题眼总结（题干里常见提示词）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>&quot;自由组合&quot;</strong> 或 <strong>&quot;位于非同源染色体上&quot;</strong> → 每对独立，比例相乘；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;某比例 ≈ 16 份&quot;</strong> → 两对，9:3:3:1 系；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;只有 A_B_ 才……&quot;</strong> → 互补型（9:7）；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;显性 A 抑制 B&quot;</strong> → 显性上位（12:3:1）；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;隐性纯合隐去……&quot;</strong> → 隐性上位（9:3:4）；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;只要有显性基因即……&quot;</strong> → 重叠型（15:1）；</li>\n<li><strong>&quot;每多一个显性基因，性状增强一档&quot;</strong> → 数量性状：按<strong>显性等位基因数</strong>分档，<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo>+</mo><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\" scriptlevel=\"0\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\left(\\dfrac12+\\dfrac12\\right)^{2n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.604em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.654em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.9029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 展开（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span> 对基因），如 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n=2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:4:6:4:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li><strong>子代全是显性但比例不是 9:3:3:1</strong>（如 9:6:1 里问&quot;某表现型比例&quot;）→ 先定表现型归类再数格子；</li>\n<li><strong>给&quot;纯合×纯合，F2 比 XX&quot;</strong> 直接对表；给&quot;测交比&quot;（<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:1:1:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> = 无互作；<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span> = 互补；<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span> = 某上位…）<strong>测交比 = 变式比 ÷9 或 ÷3 类</strong>：13:3 测交 3:1；9:7 测交 1:3。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>怎么用（三步）</h2>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>读题干锁定&quot;16 份&quot;</strong> → 默认两对自由组合，写出亲本 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AaBb\\times AaBb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span>；</li>\n<li><strong>对表定类型</strong> → 找出&quot;谁与谁同表现型&quot;（把 9:3:3:1 的四个格子按题目描述合并）；</li>\n<li><strong>只算被问的那一档</strong> → 用分子计数：如 9:6:1 中&quot;双显&quot;=9/16，问 &quot;仅一个显性&quot; = 6/16 = 3/8——注意&quot;恰好一个显性基因 ≠ 单显纯合&quot;，A_bb + aaB_ 才是&quot;任意单显&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>风险</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>别把&quot;基因自由组合&quot;误当&quot;基因连锁&quot;：连锁时比例不是 16 份（出现亲本型比例高）；</li>\n<li>9:6:1 累加作用里 6 是两个&quot;单显&quot;合并，<strong>写&quot;33:31&quot;那种小比例</strong>必先分母化成 64 判断是否三对；</li>\n<li>测交比与自交比混淆：<span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">AaBb\\times aabb</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.05017em;\">B</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">aabb</span></span></span></span> 测交为 <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:1:1:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>（无互作）/ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span>（互补）/ <span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1:2:1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span>（累加）——测交比对应的是<strong>配子组合表现型</strong>，表里写的是自交比，别混。</li>\n<li>数量性状答案可能是<strong>区间/连续值</strong>；&quot;1:4:6:4:1&quot;只适用纯合双亲 AABB × aabb，若 F1 自交前有杂合则变体。</li>\n</ul>\n","standardHtml":null,"evilHtml":null,"meta":{"status":"draft","keywords":["多对等位基因","9331变式","基因互作","数量性状","累加效应","题眼"],"summary":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼 两对及以上基因 自由组合 时，后代性状比=两对 各自分离比的乘积 （ ( 3 : 1 ) × ( 3 : 1 ) = 9 : 3 : 3 : 1 (3:1)\\times(3:1)=9:3:3:1 ( 3 :","fit":[],"updated":"Sun Mar 09 2025 08:00:00 GMT+0800 (中国标准时间)"},"breadcrumbs":[{"slug":"biology","title":"生物"},{"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传与进化"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律"},{"slug":"multi-gene-types","title":"遗传多对基因·比值变式全表与题眼"}],"children":[],"siblings":[{"slug":"epistasis-12-3-1","title":"显性上位 12:3:1（9+3 合并）","type":"example"},{"slug":"epistasis-homozygous","title":"上位效应中的纯合比例（单显 1/3）","type":"example"},{"slug":"experiment-design-multiple","title":"显隐性判断测交（全黑 vs 出现白）","type":"example"},{"slug":"gene-location","title":"基因定位实验（正反交判断）","type":"example"},{"slug":"genetic-9331","title":"9331 变式比例（拆分法）","type":"example"},{"slug":"lethal-ratio","title":"显性纯合致死比例（筛除 1/4）","type":"example"},{"slug":"mendel","title":"遗传规律","type":"knowledge"},{"slug":"two-disease-prob","title":"常染色体+伴X 两病概率（拆分相乘）","type":"example"},{"slug":"two-gene-ratio","title":"两对基因概率（拆分法）","type":"example"}]}